{"5171140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Killwright", "steam_appid": 5171140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILLWRIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight fast. Time it right. Turn one opening into a massacre.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killwright is a brutal first-person melee roguelite built around aggressive sword combat, precise timing, and controlled chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through an ever-changing medieval campaign, build your strength across each run, and survive long enough to face the horrors waiting at its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry and dodge at the last possible moment to trigger <strong>Tempo</strong>, a brief window where the world slows around you and the fight becomes yours to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE TEMPO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfectly time your defence to seize the advantage. Strike, reposition, and chain kills before the moment is gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/cc6d61e298f7cc3231d08ee0028740cc.poster.avif?t=1788018709\" aria-label=\"Fast paced 1v2 fight clip\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/cc6d61e298f7cc3231d08ee0028740cc.webm?t=1788018709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/cc6d61e298f7cc3231d08ee0028740cc.mp4?t=1788018709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT WITH EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, parry, dodge, kick and throw your weapon. Send enemies crashing into their surroundings and turn the battlefield itself into a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger as you carve your way forward, shaping your abilities and combat style as each run unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE ONSLAUGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face groups of aggressive enemies in fast, lethal encounters where positioning and timing matter as much as your blade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRUTAL, STYLIZED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismember enemies, send bodies flying and carve your way through a dark medieval world built for fast, physical violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/629359436ea610ac926b811a8e3391be.poster.avif?t=1788018709\" aria-label=\"Stylised combat clip; enemy is disarmed, player catches the weapon.\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/629359436ea610ac926b811a8e3391be.webm?t=1788018709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/629359436ea610ac926b811a8e3391be.mp4?t=1788018709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD THAT SHIFTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through procedurally generated medieval environments that change from run to run, from haunted forests to vast gothic cathedrals.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILLWRIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight fast. Time it right. Turn one opening into a massacre.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killwright is a brutal first-person melee roguelite built around aggressive sword combat, precise timing, and controlled chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through an ever-changing medieval campaign, build your strength across each run, and survive long enough to face the horrors waiting at its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry and dodge at the last possible moment to trigger <strong>Tempo</strong>, a brief window where the world slows around you and the fight becomes yours to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE TEMPO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfectly time your defence to seize the advantage. Strike, reposition, and chain kills before the moment is gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/cc6d61e298f7cc3231d08ee0028740cc.poster.avif?t=1788018709\" aria-label=\"Fast paced 1v2 fight clip\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/cc6d61e298f7cc3231d08ee0028740cc.webm?t=1788018709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/cc6d61e298f7cc3231d08ee0028740cc.mp4?t=1788018709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT WITH EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, parry, dodge, kick and throw your weapon. Send enemies crashing into their surroundings and turn the battlefield itself into a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger as you carve your way forward, shaping your abilities and combat style as each run unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE ONSLAUGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face groups of aggressive enemies in fast, lethal encounters where positioning and timing matter as much as your blade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRUTAL, STYLIZED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismember enemies, send bodies flying and carve your way through a dark medieval world built for fast, physical violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/629359436ea610ac926b811a8e3391be.poster.avif?t=1788018709\" aria-label=\"Stylised combat clip; enemy is disarmed, player catches the weapon.\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/629359436ea610ac926b811a8e3391be.webm?t=1788018709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/extras/629359436ea610ac926b811a8e3391be.mp4?t=1788018709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD THAT SHIFTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through procedurally generated medieval environments that change from run to run, from haunted forests to vast gothic cathedrals.</p>", "short_description": "Killwright is a brutal first-person melee roguelite built around precision and momentum. Fight through ever-changing runs, parry and dodge at the last possible moment to trigger Tempo, slow the world around you, and turn a single opening into a devastating chain of violence.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/3f042e84d972830ed536f9cb0064e01e3160c06c/header.jpg?t=1788018709", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/6796a81ff132d73e24c42a5b960c524eed813e5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788018709", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5171140/6796a81ff132d73e24c42a5b960c524eed813e5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788018709", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong